# PharmaExpert Overhaul: Sayqallash & UI/UX Walkthrough

I have completed the comprehensive overhaul of the Pharma Translation Platform, focusing on visual excellence, functional stability, and feature parity with the Tahrirchi (tahrir 111) reference.

## 1. Sayqallash UI Overhaul (Tahrirchi Style)

The **Uzbek (Proposed)** column now features a professional, character-precise annotation system.

### Key Improvements:
- **Interactive Popovers**: Clicking a highlighted word now reveals a Tahrirchi-style popover instead of a simple tooltip.
- **Red/Green Diffing**: Corrections are displayed using precise colors (`#F95A5A` for errors, `#40D275` for suggestions).
- **Space Precision**: Space errors are now explicitly marked with the `⎵` symbol, ensuring perfect formatting.
- **Improved Highlighting**: Annotations use a clean, sophisticated underline that doesn't clutter the UI.

> [!TIP]
> Click on any highlighted Uzbek word to see the new comparison popover. Use the "Қабул қилиш" button to apply changes instantly.

